istic Interpretability\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24155\n     [authors=Kalle Lahtinen, Liisa Mustanoja, Okko Räsänen | published=2026-07-27 | primary_category=cs.CL | id=2607.24155]\n  5. On the Popularity of GitHub Applications: A Preliminary Note\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/1507.00604\n     [authors=Hudson Borges, Marco Tulio Valente, Andre Hora, Jailton Coelho | published=2015-07-02 | primary_category=cs.SE | id=1507.00604]\n\n=== openreview (5 results) ===\n  1. Basic cuts revisited: Temporal segmentation of speech into phone-like units with statistical learning at a pre-linguistic level\n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=Tef76JqX6f\n     [authors=Okko Räsänen | rank=1 | id=Tef76JqX6f]\n  2. Acoustic analysis supports the existence of a single distributional learning mechanism in structural rule learning from an artificial language\n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=gGPnGo63Af\n     [authors=Okko Räsänen, Heikki Rasilo | rank=2 | id=gGPnGo63Af]\n  3. Code, dataset and model weights release\n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=O5cxeWpedk\n     [authors= | rank=3 | id=O5cxeWpedk]\n  4. Is Reliability of Cognitive Measures in Children Dependent on Participant Age? A Case Study with Two Large-Scale Datasets\n     https://openreview.net/forum?id=wnH6JIdqDc\n     [authors=Okko Räsänen, María Andrea Cruz Blandón, Jukka Leppänen | rank=4 | id=wnH6JIdqDc]", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
